  "name": "@nexql/mcp-linux-arm64",
  "readme": "# @nexql/mcp-linux-arm64\n\nPlatform binary package for `nexql-mcp` on **linux/arm64**.\n\nRequires **glibc 2.35+** (Ubuntu 22.04, Debian 12, RHEL 9). If you see `GLIBC_2.39 not found`, upgrade `nexql-mcp` past v0.2.1, run `cargo install nexql-mcp`, or use the Docker image.\n\nThe `bin/nexql-mcp` executable is filled in by release CI. This stub exists so the parent `nexql-mcp` npm package can declare `optionalDependencies`.\n",
  "readmeFilename": "README.md",
  "repository": {
   "type": "git",
   "url": "git+https://github.com/NexQL-OSS/mcp.git"
  },
